    "content": "Freezes the split, calibration, held-out transform, qualification gates, correspondence score, and refusal conditions for the leading open-raw alternate source. D1488 TTRTS Acquisition / Replay Preregistration v0.1 Status: PRE-SCORE / SOURCE-ONLY Physical promotion: 0 Corpus University of Southampton DOI: 10.5258/SOTON/D1488 Paper: Ibukuro et al., AIP Advances 10, 115101 (2020). Frozen split Data1–Data7: calibration; Data8–Data9: held-out physical source. If repository file names do not preserve these native run identifiers, stop and return: D1488_NATIVE_RUN_ID_UNRESOLVED. Do not relabel runs by their eventual correspondence score. Calibration Using D1–D7 only: derive current-state classifier under the paper’s source-side method; derive accepted current interval; estimate high/low state lifetimes; set T=2max(τH,τL)T=2\\max(\\tau_H,\\tau_L); set q=max(1,⌊T/tint⌋)q=\\max(1,\\lfloor T/t_{\\mathrm int}\\rfloor); freeze one resampling phase k0=0k_0=0; determine temporal-null guards from physical/UD calibration rules before held-out target join. All calibration parameters and file hashes are written before D8/D9 scoring. Held-out transform For each held-out run independently: bk=frozen-classifier(Ik0+kq). b_k=\\text{frozen-classifier}(I_{k_0+kq}). Construct Bn=(b3n,b3n+1,b3n+2), B_n=(b_{3n},b_{3n+1},b_{3n+2}), and An=Bn−1⊕Bn. A_n=B_{n-1}\\oplus B_n. Export fields: run_id,event_id,A1,A2,A3,B1,B2,B3,physical_source_status. Physical qualification gates raw trace provenance confirmed; fixed-bias acquisition identified; calibration/held-out split exact; threshold/classifier generated only from D1–D7; resampling stride generated only from D1–D7; held-out run boundaries retained; sufficient retained event count; physical stream not produced from UD outputs. Correspondence score Do not use the ST3S v0.1A scorer unchanged because its temporal null assumes one acquisition block. Use the TTRTS block-preserving product-shift null specified in this release. The shell-conditioned address null remains mandatory. Hard no-go choose best of multiple starting phases after scoring; choose best pair among 36 training/test combinations; refit threshold on D8/D9; concatenate D8/D9 and circularly shift across the acquisition boundary; promote seat exchangeability to exact spatial S3S_3; call the authors’ randomness evaluation a UD correspondence test. No physical promotion follows from corpus availability alone."
