sus baseline: - margin: +30.21% - backaction proxy: -51.04% - capacitance load: -69.44% Tradeoff The old reference tolerates more parasitic capacitance before its margin crosses zero. Therefore the new candidates dominate at the frozen 0.2 aF comparator but are not universally superior if actual layout extraction returns much larger parasitics. Approximate zero-margin parasitic points: - baseline: 3.566 aF - P-MARGIN: 1.922 aF - P-LOWLOAD: 1.537 aF Disposition DERIVED: Pareto frontier inside the declared engineering box. CANDIDATE: P-MARGIN and P-LOWLOAD. NO-GO: calling either point a globally manufacturable optimum without foundry/process data. OPEN: extracted parasitics, tunnel dynamics, latch retention, layout/process rules, fabrication. Physical promotion remains 0."
