\}} {1+|\\mathcal D|}. This preserves each lane’s complete sequence, empirical state frequencies and internal autocorrelation. Require |𝒟|+1≥600. |\\mathcal D|+1\\ge600. 5. Null A — shell-conditioned address randomization For every physical event define the shell pair hn=(wH(Anphys),wH(Bnphys)). h_n= (w_H(A_n^{phys}),w_H(B_n^{phys})). Within each of the sixteen possible shell-pair strata, randomly permute the complete physical six-bit records among only those events in the same stratum. Thus for every event the null preserves exactly (wH(Anphys),wH(Bnphys)) \\boxed{ (w_H(A_n^{phys}),w_H(B_n^{phys})) } while destroying any privileged coordinate address. Use exactly 9999 \\boxed{9999} conditional randomization replicates and fixed preregistered RNG seed 20260910. \\boxed{20260910}. For each score: pH(S)=1+#{b:S(b)≥Sobs}10000. p_H(S) = \\frac{1+\\#\\{b:S^{(b)}\\ge S^{obs}\\}} {10000}. This null tests whether address-level agreement exceeds what is explained by shell-level correspondence alone. 6. Familywise threshold There are six required p-values: pT(SAB),pT(SA),pT(SB),pH(SAB),pH(SA),pH(SB). p_T(S_{AB}),p_T(S_A),p_T(S_B), p_H(S_{AB}),p_H(S_A),p_H(S_B). Freeze αFWER=1100. \\alpha_{\\mathrm FWER}=\\frac1{100}. Bonferroni allocation: α*=1600. \\boxed{ \\alpha_*=\\frac1{600}. } Strict PASS requires all six p-values to satisfy p≤1/600. \\boxed{p\\le1/600}. 7. Verdict ST3S_CORRESPONDENCE_PASS all hard gates and all six statistical gates pass. ST3S_SHELL_ONLY temporal evidence exists but shell-conditioned address evidence fails. ST3S_NO_CORRESPONDENCE strict conjunction fails without protocol invalidity. ST3S_PROTOCOL_INVALID provenance/timing/source-map rules fail. NULL_EXCHANGEABILITY_BLOCKED time-shift null cannot be scientifically justified from pre-held-out calibration. 8. Frozen anti-repair After held-out exposure do not alter: source thresholds; sampling interval; event alignment; coordinate map; guard GG; UD predictor; unresolved-event rule; primary scores; either null model; 9999 replicate count; seed; 1/6001/600 threshold. A failure is a valid scientific outcome. 9. Claim boundary PASS would establish a held-out correspondence for the declared source-register lane only. Physical promotion remains 0 until the other independent bridge requirements close."
