_T,s select its 14 training incidences and let S_s be the exact integer full synthesis map obtained from unique tree paths. Let Hs=PH,sSs. H_s=P_{H,s}S_s. For the measured full incidence vector y, the split reconstruction and held-out prediction are ĵG(s)=SsPT,sy,ĵH(s)=HsPT,sy. \\widehat j_G^{(s)}=S_sP_{T,s}y, \\qquad \\widehat j_H^{(s)}=H_sP_{T,s}y. No held-out measurement is used to construct either prediction. 5. Full correlated covariance handling The acquisition must supply one joint covariance ΣG∈ℝ28×28,ΣG≽0, \\Sigma_G\\in\\mathbb R^{28\\times28},\\qquad \\Sigma_G\\succeq0, for the ordered 28-current estimator. This is required because an incidence can be training for one split and held out for the other; treating the two split errors as independent would generally be wrong. For split s, define the held-out residual operator As=PH,s−HsPT,s. A_s=P_{H,s}-H_sP_{T,s}. Then rs=Asy,Σrs=AsΣGAs⊤. r_s=A_sy, \\qquad \\Sigma_{r_s}=A_s\\Sigma_GA_s^\\top. The two full reconstructions are compared with d=ĵG(P)−ĵG(R2)=Cy, d=\\widehat j_G^{(P)}-\\widehat j_G^{(R2)} =C y, where C=SPPT,P−SR2PT,R2, C=S_PP_{T,P}-S_{R2}P_{T,R2}, and therefore Σd=CΣGC⊤. \\Sigma_d=C\\Sigma_GC^\\top. These are exact linear covariance pushforwards. No physical covariance entries are invented by the protocol. 6. Deterministic covariance-support gate For each residual/cross vector x with covariance Sigma_x, the scorer first checks that x lies in the numerical support of Sigma_x. A nonzero component in a declared zero-variance direction is a fail-closed covariance/support inconsistency. The eigenvalue/pseudoinverse rank cutoff is 1e-12 relative to the largest covariance eigenvalue and the null-support numerical tolerance is 1e-10; both are PROTOCOL_CONTROL values only. 7. Conditional Gaussian score Only when the acquisition declares error_model = MULTIVARIATE_NORMAL, define Qx=x⊤Σx+x,νx=rank(Σx), Q_x=x^\\top\\Sigma_x^+x, \\qquad \\nu_x=\\operatorname{rank}(\\Sigma_x), and the upper-tail p-value px=P(χνx2≥Qx). p_x=P(\\chi^2_{\\nu_x}\\ge Q_x). Three formal gates are frozen: primary held-out residual; R2 held-out residual; primary-vs-R2 full-reconstruction difference. The family-wise protocol control is αFWER=1100. \\alpha_{\\mathrm FWER}=\\frac1{100}. Bonferroni over the three formal tests gives the predeclared per-test gate αgate=1300. \\boxed{\\alpha_{\\mathrm gate}=\\frac1{300}}. This threshold is a methods control, not a theory coefficient or physical constant. 8. Verdict grammar DUAL_REPLICATION_PASS iff: authenticated same-carrier acquisition gate passes; exact primary binding passes; R2 identity passes; covariance is finite, symmetric, and PSD; covariance-support gates pass; Gaussian error model is declared; all three formal p-values satisfy p >= 1/300. DUAL_REPLICATION_FAIL iff all source/integrity gates pass but at least one of the three formal p-values is < 1/300. A PASS by one split never rescues a FAIL by the other. SOURCE_BLOCKED iff the primary source receipt or authenticated acquisition is absent/invalid. NO_PROBABILISTIC_VERDICT iff valid covariance is supplied but the acquisition does not declare the frozen Gaussian error model. Covariance-normalized diagnostics may still be reported, but no PASS/FAIL is issued. 9. R2 exact implementation falsifier The R2 predicted held-out vector must obey the already frozen exact relation −Jv2−e12+Jv2−e23−Je12−f123+Je23−f123=0. -J_{v2-e12}+J_{v2-e23}-J_{e12-f123}+J_{e23-f123}=0. Failure of the scorer to reproduce this from the R2 prediction is an implementation failure, not an experimental failure. 10. Independence language The two splits are independently generated topological partitions, but they need not be statistically independent because the same physical acquisition can place a given incidence in different roles. The joint 28×28 covariance is therefore mandatory for the formal dual-split score. 11. Freeze rule After target acquisition/release begins, do not change the primary manifest, R2 split, covariance equations, error-model declaration rule, alpha controls, test count, metric, subgroup, or verdict grammar. A parser/schema repair is lawful only before scoring and only if it does not alter the scientific rule. 12. Current execution state The scoring protocol, R2 source, schemas, two independent scorer implementations, and synthetic verification are frozen now. The exact primary split manifest remains an OPEN SOURCE GATE. This is not repaired by selecting another tree with the same path spectrum."
